== Notes ==   
* This armor is labeled [[Granite Citadel armor#Granite Citadel Exclusive Armor|Granite Citadel Exclusive Armor]] in the [["Resilience"]] monument in the [[Hall of Monuments]].
* The crystal elements of this armor have a glass-like reflective property, and is the main item modifiable by dye application.

== Trivia ==
* This armor was previously known as Elementalist Elite Hydromancer armor until the introduction of [[insignia]] to Prophecies content.

